WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:30.800 --> 00:31.399
Oh my god!

3
00:31.559 --> 00:32.240
Star Reporter Shen!

4
00:32.960 --> 00:33.600
Hello, hello, hello!

5
00:34.320 --> 00:35.719
I'm Factory Director Ma Guowen.

6
00:36.119 --> 00:37.000
Hello, Director Ma.

7
00:37.359 --> 00:37.920
Sorry to keep you waiting.

8
00:37.920 --> 00:39.600
I'll show you around before the interview.

9
00:39.719 --> 00:40.359
Come on, let's go.

10
03:01.840 --> 03:02.680
Hurry and take photos.

11
03:07.080 --> 03:07.879
What's going on here?

12
03:08.439 --> 03:10.639
Isn't this the car in Cao Jun's photo?

13
03:11.000 --> 03:11.680
Last time I came,

14
03:11.680 --> 03:12.680
you swore up and down

15
03:12.680 --> 03:13.639
that it wasn't at your factory.

16
03:15.039 --> 03:17.280
Yeah. I didn't dare say it last time.

17
03:19.560 --> 03:19.960
Fine.

18
03:20.800 --> 03:22.280
Good thing you called me on your own.

19
03:23.000 --> 03:24.039
When did this car get here?

20
03:26.599 --> 03:27.639
Back around 2000.

21
03:28.080 --> 03:29.360
Over ten years, and it wasn't scrapped?

22
03:29.360 --> 03:30.039
Why?

23
03:32.039 --> 03:32.599
Look,

24
03:32.879 --> 03:34.400
give me the salvage certificate

25
03:34.400 --> 03:36.000
that traffic control gave you back then.

26
03:36.759 --> 03:37.400
Let me take a look.

27
03:39.719 --> 03:40.800
It's been too long.

28
03:40.800 --> 03:42.080
I don't even know where it was put.

29
03:42.319 --> 03:42.960
Can't find it now.

30
03:43.960 --> 03:45.000
You never had one, did you?

31
03:46.439 --> 03:48.159
What's the real story here?

32
03:53.879 --> 03:54.560
Back then,

33
03:54.680 --> 03:55.439
at first glance,

34
03:55.680 --> 03:57.240
I could tell something was off with this car.

35
03:58.840 --> 04:01.319
I can tell it's off at first glance too.

36
04:01.800 --> 04:02.680
What kind of problem?

37
04:02.719 --> 04:04.560
Why didn't you call the police back then?

38
04:17.759 --> 04:18.399
Are you done taking photos?

39
04:18.519 --> 04:19.000
All done.

40
04:19.920 --> 04:20.920
I've noticed something about you.

41
04:21.879 --> 04:22.879
You either know nothing,

42
04:23.800 --> 04:24.959
or you're lying through your teeth.

43
04:25.759 --> 04:26.079
Tell you what.

44
04:26.319 --> 04:26.839
It's freezing out here.

45
04:26.879 --> 04:27.680
Come back to the station with me,

46
04:28.040 --> 04:29.079
and we'll talk somewhere warm.

47
04:29.199 --> 04:29.839
Let's go. Take him with us.

48
04:30.399 --> 04:30.720
Move it.

49
04:31.920 --> 04:32.439
Officer Gao...

50
04:34.000 --> 04:35.199
I'll talk! I'll talk!

51
04:35.879 --> 04:36.439
It's just...

52
04:38.199 --> 04:39.120
I was scared.

53
04:39.959 --> 04:41.680
We can't afford to cross that man.

54
04:41.959 --> 04:42.600
Who is it?

55
04:43.120 --> 04:43.800
What are you scared of?

56
04:43.800 --> 04:44.839
Who could be above the law?

57
04:49.360 --> 04:50.839
Director of Industry and Commerce.

58
04:51.639 --> 04:52.399
Zheng Aimin.

59
04:54.279 --> 04:55.639
The former director.

60
05:04.000 --> 05:05.199
Who else knows about this?

61
05:05.920 --> 05:07.199
I only told my cousin.

62
05:08.639 --> 05:11.079
And then something happened to him...

63
05:11.879 --> 05:12.639
That terrified me.

64
05:13.240 --> 05:13.839
Scared of what?

65
05:15.680 --> 05:17.120
I was afraid I got him killed.

66
05:19.439 --> 05:19.959
What do you mean?

67
05:20.040 --> 05:20.959
Back then...

68
05:21.360 --> 05:23.680
I was scared that obeying his order

69
05:23.680 --> 05:24.959
to scrap the car

70
05:25.360 --> 05:26.720
would bring the police to my door later.

71
05:27.199 --> 05:29.759
So I asked my cousin over to discuss it

72
05:29.759 --> 05:30.519
and give me some advice.

73
05:31.519 --> 05:32.879
What did you drag me over here for?

74
05:32.920 --> 05:33.639
Take a look at this for me.

75
05:33.680 --> 05:35.199
Look at what? I'm supposed to be at work!

76
05:35.759 --> 05:37.040
Anyone can tell this car was in a wreck.

77
05:38.079 --> 05:39.720
They made me scrap it without any papers.

78
05:40.160 --> 05:40.720
Look at it.

79
05:40.759 --> 05:41.920
What? Without any papers at all,

80
05:41.920 --> 05:43.040
you dared take this job?

81
05:43.040 --> 05:43.920
What the hell is wrong with you?

82
05:44.360 --> 05:45.199
You're unbelievable.

83
05:46.879 --> 05:47.600
Just this car...

84
05:49.800 --> 05:50.519
Wait, this car...

85
05:52.040 --> 05:53.079
Who owns it?

86
05:54.079 --> 05:54.639
I don't know.

87
05:57.040 --> 05:58.519
Then who told you to take it in?

88
06:04.399 --> 06:04.920
Who was it?

89
06:06.600 --> 06:07.360
Fine, don't tell me then.

90
06:07.399 --> 06:08.399
I don't even want to get involved in your crap.

91
06:08.439 --> 06:09.240
I've got to get back to work.

92
06:09.399 --> 06:10.120
I'll tell you!

93
06:14.319 --> 06:15.519
Brother Li came to me.

94
06:15.759 --> 06:17.600
He drives for an official.

95
06:17.839 --> 06:18.319
An official?

96
06:19.680 --> 06:20.160
Who?

97
06:20.680 --> 06:22.800
Zheng Aimin, head of Industry &amp; Commerce.

98
06:24.279 --> 06:24.879
Director Zheng?

99
06:27.519 --> 06:28.800
What's Director Zheng got to do with this?

100
06:28.959 --> 06:29.639
I don't know.

101
06:33.240 --> 06:34.560
This is clearly a hit-and-run wreck!

102
06:34.800 --> 06:35.720
Why would he get involved in this...

103
06:35.959 --> 06:37.000
What for?

104
06:41.199 --> 06:43.079
Why drag you into this out of nowhere?

105
07:10.879 --> 07:11.519
It's him.

106
07:13.600 --> 07:13.959
Who?

107
07:14.399 --> 07:15.279
You know the owner?

108
07:15.879 --> 07:16.959
No, I don't. No.

109
07:17.120 --> 07:18.000
How would I know him?

110
07:20.079 --> 07:20.639
Bro.

111
07:21.079 --> 07:21.839
Take a look at this newspaper.

112
07:23.000 --> 07:23.720
It's from today.

113
07:24.519 --> 07:25.240
Look at this car.

114
07:26.720 --> 07:29.639
"Taxi driver tragically killed."

115
07:30.319 --> 07:31.959
"Severe car crash."

116
07:34.439 --> 07:35.680
Look at this car, it...

117
07:35.680 --> 07:36.759
Aren't the two connected somehow?

118
07:41.199 --> 07:42.319
Hit-and-run.

119
07:43.800 --> 07:44.759
Hit-and-run.

120
07:45.399 --> 07:46.439
You knew about it?

121
07:47.560 --> 07:48.279
No, I don't.

122
07:48.759 --> 07:49.920
How would I know that?

123
07:50.279 --> 07:51.120
Anyway, uh...

124
07:51.439 --> 07:52.120
Get back to work.

125
07:52.120 --> 07:52.959
I'm heading to work.

126
07:53.519 --> 07:54.199
Wait, Bro.

127
07:54.639 --> 07:55.519
I asked you here

128
07:55.519 --> 07:56.360
to give me advice.

129
07:56.399 --> 07:57.160
Do whatever the hell you want.

130
07:57.160 --> 07:57.600
I've got work to do.

131
07:57.639 --> 07:58.839
Come on, you're my brother.

132
07:58.839 --> 07:59.519
Help me out.

133
07:59.519 --> 08:01.319
Let me finish my shift first.

134
08:01.319 --> 08:02.319
Just go on with your work.

135
08:02.800 --> 08:03.319
Wait, Bro...

136
08:03.319 --> 08:04.120
Look, go do your work.

137
08:04.160 --> 08:04.759
Go on.

138
08:05.040 --> 08:07.439
Later, I lied to Brother Li.

139
08:07.519 --> 08:09.040
I said I'd destroyed the car.

140
08:09.439 --> 08:10.000
And then?

141
08:10.279 --> 08:11.439
Then...

142
08:12.920 --> 08:14.000
later on, it seemed he

143
08:14.079 --> 08:15.560
found out who owned the car.

144
08:15.759 --> 08:16.120
Who?

145
08:16.519 --> 08:17.439
That, I don't know.

146
08:17.439 --> 08:18.160
My cousin didn't tell me.

147
08:18.959 --> 08:20.439
He said I shouldn't know too much.

148
08:20.439 --> 08:21.279
Knowing too much

149
08:21.519 --> 08:22.319
isn't good for anyone.

150
08:24.279 --> 08:25.319
I just feel this car

151
08:25.399 --> 08:27.759
is definitely tied to my cousin's death.

152
08:42.000 --> 08:43.519
Chen Yuan just went to the police station,

153
08:43.679 --> 08:44.799
but he couldn't see his dad either.

154
08:45.639 --> 08:46.519
Tell me, how could his dad

155
08:46.519 --> 08:48.240
get into such a huge mess?

156
08:50.200 --> 08:50.799
Do you think

157
08:51.679 --> 08:54.120
you could help pull some strings?

158
08:57.120 --> 08:58.840
Mind your own business.

159
09:08.200 --> 09:10.159
What's wrong with this gas stove?

160
09:10.159 --> 09:11.440
It won't even light.

161
09:12.159 --> 09:13.960
I'm fuming here, you want some of that?

162
09:15.240 --> 09:17.320
What are you yelling for?

163
09:17.440 --> 09:19.120
I'm fuming too!

164
09:29.000 --> 09:30.279
What did the police say?

165
09:30.399 --> 09:31.519
How should I know?

166
09:35.240 --> 09:36.039
Calm down.

167
09:36.639 --> 09:37.799
Tell Chen Yuan

168
09:37.840 --> 09:38.879
to stop running around blindly.

169
09:39.559 --> 09:40.559
I'll figure something out

170
09:40.559 --> 09:41.519
and pull some strings for him.

171
09:47.519 --> 09:48.360
I'll get it, I'll get it.

172
09:49.039 --> 09:49.799
Who is it?

173
09:50.159 --> 09:50.879
Coming!

174
09:56.519 --> 09:56.919
Hello.

175
09:57.240 --> 09:58.159
Is Zheng Aimin home?

176
09:59.320 --> 09:59.960
And you are...?

177
10:21.240 --> 10:22.279
Young officer,

178
10:23.279 --> 10:24.720
I've been waiting here for quite a while.

179
10:25.120 --> 10:26.679
Why don't we get started?

180
10:34.919 --> 10:35.519
Director Zheng.

181
10:35.759 --> 10:36.759
Sorry to take up your time.

182
10:37.120 --> 10:38.120
Sure. Thank you.

183
10:46.440 --> 10:47.320
We're all set.

184
10:48.279 --> 10:49.159
Then let's...

185
10:49.559 --> 10:50.399
get ready to start.

186
10:50.559 --> 10:51.240
Okay, okay.

187
10:54.440 --> 10:55.600
First of all,

188
10:56.279 --> 10:58.960
December 31st, 1999.

189
10:59.000 --> 11:00.039
What were you doing that day?

190
11:03.000 --> 11:04.440
1999?

191
11:05.679 --> 11:07.120
Oh, good lord.

192
11:07.720 --> 11:09.159
How many years has it been?

193
11:09.720 --> 11:10.879
Who could possibly remember that?

194
11:12.039 --> 11:13.120
A bit tough on you, huh?

195
11:13.600 --> 11:14.679
Take your time to think.

196
11:14.720 --> 11:15.360
No rush.

197
11:15.519 --> 11:16.399
We've got plenty of time.

198
11:25.320 --> 11:26.320
I think...

199
11:27.679 --> 11:28.879
I remember a little.

200
11:30.960 --> 11:32.120
That day...

201
11:32.799 --> 11:34.240
I think I was with Ma Guowen,

202
11:34.240 --> 11:36.559
having a meal at a restaurant.

203
11:37.080 --> 11:37.559
Right.

204
11:38.840 --> 11:40.320
That was quite a memorable day.

205
11:40.919 --> 11:41.879
Millennium Eve.

206
11:42.120 --> 11:45.240
Plus, Lapi Brewery's auction succeeded,

207
11:45.840 --> 11:46.799
so they held a victory banquet.

208
11:47.120 --> 11:47.840
You attended too,

209
11:47.919 --> 11:48.320
didn't you?

210
11:49.919 --> 11:50.559
Right, right.

211
11:52.679 --> 11:53.240
Who was there?

212
11:55.000 --> 11:56.360
At my age...

213
11:57.879 --> 11:59.240
With a whole table of people,

214
11:59.399 --> 12:00.519
I can't recall.

215
12:02.679 --> 12:04.279
Ma Guowen must've been there, right?

216
12:04.639 --> 12:05.000
Yes.

217
12:05.000 --> 12:05.519
Right?

218
12:06.320 --> 12:07.360
Was the deputy director there?

219
12:07.360 --> 12:07.919
Yes.

220
12:08.879 --> 12:09.759
So both directors were there.

221
12:09.759 --> 12:10.799
Was the chief engineer there?

222
12:12.600 --> 12:13.600
Was Chen Qingchun there?

223
12:17.799 --> 12:18.360
I think...

224
12:18.639 --> 12:20.000
I think Old Chen was there.

225
12:20.600 --> 12:21.159
He was.

226
12:21.639 --> 12:22.879
"Old Chen"?

227
12:23.000 --> 12:23.840
Sounds pretty close.

228
12:24.879 --> 12:25.720
Chen.

229
12:25.879 --> 12:26.879
Qing.

230
12:27.240 --> 12:27.720
Chun.

231
12:28.960 --> 12:29.879
Where did you go afterward?

232
12:32.200 --> 12:33.000
After it wrapped up,

233
12:33.080 --> 12:34.240
I went home.

234
12:34.600 --> 12:35.399
No after-party?

235
12:35.720 --> 12:36.559
No.

236
12:37.159 --> 12:38.399
My health wasn't that great.

237
12:39.120 --> 12:40.919
During dinner, they talked about

238
12:41.159 --> 12:42.720
going to some karaoke joint.

239
12:43.519 --> 12:44.639
That Ma Guowen,

240
12:44.919 --> 12:46.320
he always liked to sing.

241
12:46.879 --> 12:48.519
Big and burly as he was,

242
12:48.759 --> 12:50.919
at Lapi Brewery's annual gala,

243
12:51.240 --> 12:52.240
he actually sang really well.

244
12:52.519 --> 12:54.080
His specialty was that...

245
12:54.240 --> 12:54.919
What was it called?

246
12:54.919 --> 12:55.679
One more from the brewery, Director Zheng.

247
12:55.960 --> 12:57.039
Do you recognize this car?

248
13:08.919 --> 13:10.240
20793.

249
13:11.679 --> 13:12.360
Sound familiar?

250
13:18.559 --> 13:20.960
Shaking your head means you don't recall?

251
13:25.919 --> 13:26.519
Director Zheng,

252
13:26.840 --> 13:27.559
you know as well as anyone

253
13:28.440 --> 13:29.360
that we didn't bring you in

254
13:30.200 --> 13:31.519
without good reason.

255
13:34.879 --> 13:35.960
It has to do with this car.

256
13:39.519 --> 13:40.799
You're a retired official,

257
13:41.879 --> 13:42.799
a sensible man.

258
13:43.320 --> 13:44.559
Don't make us spell it out.

259
13:45.120 --> 13:46.120
Tell us yourself.

260
13:51.279 --> 13:52.000
I'll talk.

261
13:53.879 --> 13:55.039
Chen Qingchun...

262
13:55.879 --> 13:57.840
begged me to scrap a car for him.

263
13:59.120 --> 14:00.080
I figured,

264
14:00.080 --> 14:01.440
since an in-law asked,

265
14:02.039 --> 14:03.679
I'd take care of it for him.

266
14:05.039 --> 14:05.879
I admit,

267
14:06.039 --> 14:07.360
abusing my official position,

268
14:07.600 --> 14:09.000
I pulled some strings for him.

269
14:09.960 --> 14:10.519
I deeply regret it.

270
14:10.519 --> 14:11.639
Were you two in-laws back then?

271
14:14.639 --> 14:16.679
When did Zheng Xiaoqin and Chen Yuan marry?

272
14:17.399 --> 14:18.519
What year was that?

273
14:24.720 --> 14:26.279
Off track, completely off track.

274
14:28.039 --> 14:28.799
Here's the thing.

275
14:29.960 --> 14:33.159
You helped Chen Qingchun scrap a car,

276
14:33.519 --> 14:35.279
and then he got the exact same model.

277
14:35.519 --> 14:36.440
That's very strange.

278
14:36.879 --> 14:38.519
I can't figure out why.

279
14:40.519 --> 14:41.240
As for Old Chen...

280
14:41.240 --> 14:44.200
why did he buy the exact same car?

281
14:45.279 --> 14:46.200
I don't know.

282
14:50.000 --> 14:51.200
I made mistakes.

283
14:53.279 --> 14:54.360
When Lapi Brewery

284
14:55.080 --> 14:56.039
was being sold off,

285
14:56.360 --> 14:57.519
on Ma Guowen's behalf,

286
14:57.799 --> 14:58.960
I drove down the plant's price,

287
14:59.519 --> 15:00.399
and helped him

288
15:00.399 --> 15:01.559
grease some wheels.

289
15:02.559 --> 15:04.360
I admit I took some...

290
15:05.200 --> 15:06.200
some kickbacks.

291
15:06.799 --> 15:09.600
I did commit misconduct in office.

292
15:10.000 --> 15:10.759
I deeply regret it.

293
15:10.759 --> 15:12.120
Did I ask you about Ma Guowen?

294
15:13.639 --> 15:15.000
I asked about Chen Qingchun.

295
15:15.639 --> 15:16.679
I asked about that car!

296
15:17.320 --> 15:18.799
Back in 2000,

297
15:19.120 --> 15:20.840
using illegal procedures,

298
15:20.919 --> 15:23.840
you helped Chen Qingchun scrap a wreck.

299
15:24.080 --> 15:24.639
Did you or didn't you?

300
15:25.799 --> 15:27.039
And then Chen Qingchun

301
15:27.120 --> 15:28.679
got an identical replacement.

302
15:28.879 --> 15:30.720
You made the calls. You pulled the strings.

303
15:30.720 --> 15:31.559
Why?

304
15:35.200 --> 15:35.679
Young man...

305
15:35.679 --> 15:37.960
Why did you do him this favor?

306
15:40.080 --> 15:41.600
Didn't I just tell you?

307
15:41.600 --> 15:43.279
After all, I was an official.

308
15:43.440 --> 15:46.159
I had far more connections than he did.

309
16:11.399 --> 16:12.440
Chen Qingchun is in custody.

310
16:12.440 --> 16:13.159
You know that, right?

311
16:17.440 --> 16:19.080
His attitude is nothing like yours.

312
16:20.279 --> 16:21.440
He's fully cooperating with us.

313
16:25.600 --> 16:26.840
Let me tell you, Zheng Aimin,

314
16:27.080 --> 16:28.440
I'm asking you nicely right now.

315
16:28.440 --> 16:29.559
I'm giving you a chance.

316
16:30.960 --> 16:32.639
If you keep beating around the bush...

317
16:39.519 --> 16:40.120
I'll talk!

318
16:41.320 --> 16:42.759
He forced me into it!

319
16:42.759 --> 16:43.639
How did he coerce you?

320
16:43.720 --> 16:44.679
Did he put a knife to your throat?

321
16:44.720 --> 16:46.519
That night, he was driving drunk.

322
16:47.879 --> 16:49.559
He... Now that he's in custody,

323
16:50.240 --> 16:51.080
that old bastard

324
16:51.080 --> 16:52.519
is definitely slinging mud at me!

325
16:52.519 --> 16:54.039
I asked you how he coerced you.

326
16:54.600 --> 16:55.360
That night,

327
16:55.559 --> 16:56.440
he was driving drunk.

328
16:56.759 --> 16:58.600
He hit an out-of-town taxi.

329
16:58.720 --> 16:59.679
What kind of taxi?

330
16:59.799 --> 17:00.679
A red one.

331
17:06.319 --> 17:07.359
From Qingzhou?

332
17:09.319 --> 17:09.759
Yes.

333
17:11.160 --> 17:12.640
An out-of-town taxi.

334
17:14.160 --> 17:15.160
At the time, the driver...

335
17:15.759 --> 17:16.640
he was still alive.

336
17:17.720 --> 17:18.400
I wanted to save him.

337
17:19.000 --> 17:21.039
But... but Old Chen wouldn't let me.

338
17:21.279 --> 17:21.920
He hit me.

339
17:22.119 --> 17:22.880
He cursed at me.

340
17:23.079 --> 17:23.920
I was terrified.

341
17:24.000 --> 17:25.880
I said he could still be saved!

342
17:26.240 --> 17:27.240
He wouldn't let me.

343
17:32.839 --> 17:33.440
That day,

344
17:36.000 --> 17:37.240
it was snowing heavily.

345
17:40.519 --> 17:41.400
Chen Qingchun

346
17:41.680 --> 17:42.920
was driving

347
17:44.039 --> 17:45.400
while chatting with me

348
17:46.039 --> 17:47.519
about his son, Chen Yuan.

349
17:49.119 --> 17:51.440
He wanted him to meet my daughter.

350
17:53.359 --> 17:54.160
"Director Zheng,

351
17:55.240 --> 17:57.359
why not introduce the two young folks?

352
17:57.359 --> 17:58.119
What do you say?"

353
17:58.119 --> 17:59.000
"Sure.

354
17:59.000 --> 18:00.960
Let's see if there's any spark."

355
18:05.119 --> 18:07.079
Roaming Far and Wide,

356
18:07.640 --> 18:10.279
The roads are long, the waters endless,

357
18:19.880 --> 18:21.000
Lost in the haze,

358
18:21.079 --> 18:22.960
From village to village,

359
18:23.440 --> 18:25.279
Roaming Far and Wide...

360
19:10.680 --> 19:11.359
Chen Qingchun!

361
19:11.519 --> 19:13.319
You... you hit someone!

362
19:14.200 --> 19:14.920
You're lying!

363
19:15.400 --> 19:16.640
He crashed into us!

364
19:22.359 --> 19:23.519
The driver is still alive.

365
19:23.960 --> 19:25.359
Let's pull him out together.

366
19:25.400 --> 19:26.240
He can still make it!

367
19:26.240 --> 19:26.680
Come here.

368
19:31.240 --> 19:31.839
Listen to me.

369
19:33.559 --> 19:35.200
He was the one drinking,

370
19:35.359 --> 19:36.319
and he hit us!

371
19:36.519 --> 19:37.319
Did you hear me?

372
19:37.359 --> 19:37.640
No...

373
19:37.839 --> 19:38.519
He... he...

374
19:38.640 --> 19:40.079
We were the ones drinking!

375
19:40.240 --> 19:41.240
You can't do this!

376
19:41.240 --> 19:42.039
Bullshit!

377
20:00.079 --> 20:00.960
Chen Qingchun, let go!

378
20:01.119 --> 20:02.000
You can't do this!

379
20:02.440 --> 20:03.519
Chen Qingchun, what are you doing?!

380
20:05.160 --> 20:06.519
I'll tell you one more time.

381
20:07.279 --> 20:08.599
He was drinking,

382
20:09.039 --> 20:09.960
and crashed into us!

383
20:10.119 --> 20:11.160
You can't do this!

384
20:11.200 --> 20:11.880
Let's call 120 first!

385
20:11.920 --> 20:12.519
Screw that!

386
20:12.559 --> 20:13.119
There's still time!

387
20:16.759 --> 20:17.599
Chen Qingchun!

388
20:18.160 --> 20:19.599
You can't do this!

389
20:20.160 --> 20:21.200
Let's call 120!

390
20:21.200 --> 20:22.440
He can still survive!

391
20:25.160 --> 20:25.920
Chen Qingchun!

392
20:26.400 --> 20:27.880
You can't do this!

393
20:31.000 --> 20:32.000
Chen Qingchun!

394
20:32.720 --> 20:33.440
Shut up!

395
20:40.359 --> 20:41.160
Chen Qingchun!

396
20:41.519 --> 20:42.319
I'm begging you!

397
20:42.319 --> 20:43.519
You can't do this!

398
20:44.839 --> 20:45.839
You can't do this!

399
20:46.160 --> 20:47.720
I'm telling you one last time,

400
20:48.799 --> 20:49.640
Zheng Aimin.

401
20:50.440 --> 20:51.720
He was drinking,

402
20:52.559 --> 20:54.039
and he hit us!

403
21:01.160 --> 21:01.920
What are you staring for?

404
21:02.119 --> 21:03.079
Come help me!

405
21:04.000 --> 21:04.519
Hurry!

406
21:07.599 --> 21:08.119
Hurry!

407
21:40.640 --> 21:41.640
Chen Qingchun!

408
21:41.960 --> 21:42.960
You killed my dad!

409
21:43.039 --> 21:43.519
Get out!

410
21:43.920 --> 21:45.160
You killed my father!

411
21:45.680 --> 21:46.119
Xuelin...

412
21:46.119 --> 21:46.920
You killed my father!

413
21:46.920 --> 21:48.440
Why didn't you save him? Are you crazy?

414
21:48.839 --> 21:49.640
Why?

415
21:49.640 --> 21:50.079
Xuelin...

416
21:50.079 --> 21:51.240
Why did you make him drink?

417
21:51.359 --> 21:51.960
Xuelin, it wasn't me!

418
21:52.279 --> 21:53.119
Why did you—

419
21:53.119 --> 21:53.559
It wasn't me!

420
21:53.599 --> 21:54.880
You murderer!

421
21:54.920 --> 21:56.920
Why didn't you take him to the hospital? Come on!

422
21:56.920 --> 21:57.680
Calm down! Get out!

423
21:57.680 --> 21:59.359
Why didn't you save him?

424
21:59.799 --> 22:00.200
Get out!

425
22:00.720 --> 22:01.839
Say something! Xuelin...

426
22:02.000 --> 22:02.599
Get out!

427
22:03.279 --> 22:04.279
It wasn't like that!

428
22:05.440 --> 22:06.440
It wasn't like that!

429
22:09.440 --> 22:11.200
Zheng Aimin was driving that day.

430
22:12.960 --> 22:14.279
He was driving my car.

431
22:16.319 --> 22:17.519
He had too much to drink that day.

432
22:18.640 --> 22:19.960
I couldn't stop him.

433
22:21.920 --> 22:22.880
He insisted on driving.

434
22:23.559 --> 22:24.160
Old Chen,

435
22:25.000 --> 22:26.440
how's my driving?

436
22:26.440 --> 22:26.880
Great.

437
22:28.759 --> 22:29.559
Even better than mine.

438
22:30.400 --> 22:31.000
Right?

439
22:31.119 --> 22:32.079
Even without a license,

440
22:32.160 --> 22:33.880
I drive better than you who has one!

441
22:37.720 --> 22:38.920
Roaming Far and Wide...

442
22:39.440 --> 22:40.119
No need.

443
22:44.039 --> 22:44.680
Who's this?

444
22:45.079 --> 22:45.839
That's my son.

445
22:47.039 --> 22:48.839
The lad looks sharp!

446
22:49.880 --> 22:51.000
He teaches at a university.

447
22:52.920 --> 22:53.519
Take a look.

448
22:53.640 --> 22:54.559
Recognize her?

449
22:57.519 --> 22:58.519
Isn't this...

450
22:58.519 --> 23:00.680
the TV weather forecaster, Zheng Xiaoqin?

451
23:00.759 --> 23:01.559
That's right!

452
23:01.559 --> 23:02.519
Your daughter?

453
23:03.599 --> 23:05.200
She's gorgeous!

454
23:06.119 --> 23:07.240
She's so elegant!

455
23:08.119 --> 23:10.240
She must have tons of suitors!

456
23:10.519 --> 23:11.720
Let me tell you,

457
23:12.240 --> 23:13.960
young people these days...

458
23:15.680 --> 23:17.119
All they care about is work.

459
23:18.599 --> 23:20.000
They say they have no time to date.

460
23:20.160 --> 23:21.240
Doesn't it just drive you crazy?

461
23:21.240 --> 23:21.960
Yeah, tell me about it.

462
23:22.400 --> 23:23.799
My son's the same way.

463
23:24.000 --> 23:25.839
Plenty of girls chase after him,

464
23:25.839 --> 23:27.400
but he just doesn't care.

465
23:29.119 --> 23:31.680
Roaming Far and Wide, the road is long...

466
23:48.440 --> 23:49.079
Old Chen.

467
23:49.519 --> 23:50.200
Go down and check it out.

468
23:51.160 --> 23:51.799
Me?

469
23:53.160 --> 23:54.000
Hurry up!

470
23:54.759 --> 23:55.680
All right, all right.

471
24:18.920 --> 24:19.680
Director Zheng...

472
24:20.440 --> 24:21.400
You hit someone.

473
24:21.640 --> 24:22.359
Bullshit!

474
24:23.319 --> 24:24.440
He hit us!

475
24:31.039 --> 24:31.920
He's still alive.

476
24:32.160 --> 24:34.000
Let's pull him out.

477
24:34.039 --> 24:34.799
Shut up!

478
24:35.319 --> 24:35.799
Come here.

479
24:38.440 --> 24:39.039
Get over here.

480
24:39.519 --> 24:40.519
You listen to me.

481
24:41.039 --> 24:42.799
He's the one who hit us.

482
24:43.960 --> 24:44.759
Don't say a word.

483
25:02.960 --> 25:03.640
It was him.

484
25:04.519 --> 25:05.519
He was drinking.

485
25:06.000 --> 25:07.319
He drove drunk

486
25:07.680 --> 25:08.519
and hit us.

487
25:09.960 --> 25:11.039
You'd better remember that,

488
25:14.200 --> 25:15.000
Director Zheng.

489
25:57.000 --> 25:57.799
Old Chen.

490
25:59.359 --> 26:00.519
We need to push

491
26:01.119 --> 26:02.000
the car down.

492
26:03.839 --> 26:04.640
Push the car?

493
26:04.839 --> 26:05.519
Yeah.

494
26:06.359 --> 26:07.519
If we do this,

495
26:08.319 --> 26:09.519
we've got to go all the way.

496
26:11.200 --> 26:11.640
Go.

497
26:12.599 --> 26:13.519
Get behind the car.

498
26:14.400 --> 26:14.960
Hurry up.

499
26:18.319 --> 26:19.039
Push harder!

500
26:20.359 --> 26:21.240
One!

501
26:21.279 --> 26:22.039
Two!

502
26:26.000 --> 26:28.200
Zheng Aimin was the one who wanted to kill that driver.

503
26:30.359 --> 26:31.759
The look in his eyes back then...

504
26:32.920 --> 26:34.119
It was truly terrifying.

505
26:37.279 --> 26:38.240
I admit it.

506
26:39.559 --> 26:40.960
I was cowardly and weak.

507
26:42.640 --> 26:43.559
I didn't dare fight back.

508
26:45.920 --> 26:46.839
All these years,

509
26:47.160 --> 26:48.640
for the sake of my kids and family,

510
26:50.759 --> 26:52.319
I didn't dare speak the truth.

511
26:55.559 --> 26:57.000
But the real murderer

512
26:57.400 --> 26:58.519
is Zheng Aimin.

513
26:58.799 --> 27:00.079
He personally poured the liquor

514
27:00.519 --> 27:02.000
and choked the driver to death.

515
27:04.079 --> 27:06.240
What was Zheng Aimin's connection to Cao Jun?

516
27:07.759 --> 27:09.599
Cao Jun somehow found out

517
27:11.039 --> 27:12.519
about that car in the scrapyard.

518
27:13.839 --> 27:14.799
He came to blackmail me.

519
27:16.599 --> 27:18.119
I went to discuss it with Zheng Aimin,

520
27:20.119 --> 27:21.519
and he told me to kill Cao Jun.

521
27:22.960 --> 27:23.799
Otherwise,

522
27:24.680 --> 27:25.960
he would kill me to keep me quiet.

523
27:26.839 --> 27:28.599
I watched Chen Qingchun

524
27:28.799 --> 27:30.400
pour liquor into that driver's mouth.

525
27:30.880 --> 27:31.400
Really.

526
27:32.039 --> 27:34.000
I... I was terrified back then.

527
27:34.279 --> 27:36.000
I just wanted to get out of there as fast as possible.

528
27:39.039 --> 27:40.200
Were you injured at the time?

529
27:41.319 --> 27:42.240
Yes, I was.

530
27:42.720 --> 27:44.200
My nose was bleeding from the hit.

531
27:44.319 --> 27:44.799
What about your head?

532
27:44.799 --> 27:46.000
It was buzzing from the crash too.

533
27:48.119 --> 27:50.119
Where did Chen Qingchun get the liquor?

534
27:50.680 --> 27:51.680
From the car's trunk.

535
27:52.279 --> 27:52.839
What kind of liquor?

536
27:52.880 --> 27:53.519
Mao liquor.

537
27:53.839 --> 27:55.839
The unfinished Mao liquor from that day.

538
27:56.240 --> 27:57.519
Where did Zheng Aimin get the liquor?

539
27:58.519 --> 27:59.519
From the trunk.

540
28:00.119 --> 28:00.759
What kind of liquor?

541
28:02.359 --> 28:03.160
Xiaoshao liquor.

542
28:03.799 --> 28:04.559
Five Star brand.

543
28:07.319 --> 28:08.519
Right now, the two suspects

544
28:08.839 --> 28:10.039
have given conflicting accounts.

545
28:10.720 --> 28:12.400
Given the severe vehicle damage back then,

546
28:12.799 --> 28:13.839
and limited forensic capabilities,

547
28:14.240 --> 28:15.759
no further clues could be found.

548
28:16.599 --> 28:17.920
This traffic accident is being reclassified

549
28:17.920 --> 28:19.240
as a suspected criminal case,

550
28:19.559 --> 28:20.359
and the investigation is reopened.

551
28:22.440 --> 28:22.920
Han Chuang,

552
28:23.359 --> 28:23.960
take Forensics

553
28:24.240 --> 28:25.640
to re-examine the vehicle from the scene.

554
28:25.960 --> 28:27.039
Try to uncover new leads.

555
28:27.160 --> 28:27.519
Got it.

556
28:27.920 --> 28:28.920
The rest of you, go to traffic control

557
28:29.160 --> 28:30.240
to pull all files on this case

558
28:30.319 --> 28:31.519
from the year 2000

559
28:31.640 --> 28:32.279
for cross-referencing.

560
28:32.519 --> 28:33.319
Yes, sir.

561
29:01.160 --> 29:01.720
How's it looking?

562
29:02.279 --> 29:02.799
Captain Han.

563
29:03.599 --> 29:04.839
Near the steering wheel and driver's seat,

564
29:04.839 --> 29:05.880
we found suspected bloodstains.

565
29:06.960 --> 29:07.519
After so many years,

566
29:07.519 --> 29:08.279
can you still get results?

567
29:08.519 --> 29:09.119
From what we know,

568
29:09.240 --> 29:10.400
the car was covered with a tarp all along.

569
29:10.599 --> 29:11.519
It was a relatively sealed environment.

570
29:11.920 --> 29:12.839
Under specific conditions,

571
29:12.960 --> 29:13.599
biological DNA

572
29:13.599 --> 29:14.519
can last for 15 years.

573
29:15.160 --> 29:15.720
Then hurry up.

574
29:15.720 --> 29:16.400
Take it back for testing.

575
29:16.519 --> 29:16.839
Will do.

576
29:21.680 --> 29:23.279
Here's what I got from traffic police.

577
29:25.920 --> 29:27.559
And here's the blood test report.

578
29:28.640 --> 29:29.920
We tested the steering wheel

579
29:29.920 --> 29:31.759
and blood samples near the driver's seat.

580
29:32.359 --> 29:34.599
They match Zheng Aimin's biological profile.

581
29:34.759 --> 29:35.839
Zheng Aimin was driving?

582
29:36.119 --> 29:36.599
Yes.

583
29:37.039 --> 29:37.839
Zheng Aimin lied.

584
29:43.920 --> 29:45.880
I think both of them are lying.

585
29:46.759 --> 29:47.759
I'll ask you one more time.

586
29:48.359 --> 29:48.960
The car...

587
29:49.319 --> 29:49.960
who was driving?

588
29:51.119 --> 29:52.000
Officer,

589
29:52.680 --> 29:54.240
how many times do I have to say it?

590
29:54.759 --> 29:56.720
Chen Qingchun was driving.

591
29:56.880 --> 29:57.680
Are you sure?

592
30:00.799 --> 30:01.279
Fine.

593
30:03.799 --> 30:05.720
In the vehicle involved in the crash,

594
30:05.720 --> 30:08.680
we found blood on the floor mat.

595
30:09.920 --> 30:10.759
After testing,

596
30:11.519 --> 30:12.519
the blood collected

597
30:12.559 --> 30:13.599
and your DNA

598
30:13.799 --> 30:14.759
came back as an exact match.

599
30:16.599 --> 30:17.680
Explain that to me.

600
30:21.759 --> 30:22.359
The car...

601
30:22.880 --> 30:23.920
who was really driving?

602
30:31.519 --> 30:32.279
Officer...

603
30:33.519 --> 30:34.319
I admit it.

604
30:35.599 --> 30:36.559
I was the one driving.

605
30:37.720 --> 30:38.559
Playing games with me?

606
30:38.559 --> 30:38.920
No!

607
30:38.920 --> 30:39.359
No, no, no!

608
30:39.359 --> 30:39.880
I was wrong.

609
30:39.920 --> 30:41.319
I... I'm really sorry.

610
30:41.839 --> 30:43.359
Please listen to my explanation!

611
30:44.000 --> 30:45.359
Because I didn't have a license,

612
30:45.799 --> 30:47.400
and I had been drinking...

613
30:47.759 --> 30:50.359
It was my first year as bureau director.

614
30:50.440 --> 30:52.319
I couldn't afford any trouble!

615
30:53.359 --> 30:54.279
Officer,

616
30:54.960 --> 30:55.559
I was wrong.

617
30:55.920 --> 30:56.680
I was truly wrong.

618
30:57.319 --> 30:59.079
I... I had no respect for the law.

619
30:59.640 --> 31:01.519
I drove drunk without a license.

620
31:01.599 --> 31:02.319
I accept the punishment.

621
31:02.440 --> 31:03.519
Whatever the penalty, I'll take it.

622
31:03.799 --> 31:05.279
But I didn't kill that man!

623
31:05.920 --> 31:08.200
The killer was Chen Qingchun!

624
31:08.799 --> 31:11.160
At the 2000 Gao Wusong crash scene,

625
31:11.359 --> 31:12.839
investigators found

626
31:12.839 --> 31:14.000
a Five Star Xiaoshao liquor bottle.

627
31:14.680 --> 31:16.960
Many fingerprints were found on the bottle,

628
31:17.759 --> 31:19.759
but given the case classification then,

629
31:19.920 --> 31:21.000
they didn't pursue it further.

630
31:21.839 --> 31:22.599
However, this time,

631
31:22.720 --> 31:25.400
we took Zheng and Chen's fingerprints

632
31:25.400 --> 31:26.599
and ran a comparison.

633
31:26.960 --> 31:28.640
The fingerprints on the bottle

634
31:28.920 --> 31:30.079
and Chen Qingchun's fingerprints

635
31:30.400 --> 31:31.319
were an exact match.

636
31:32.880 --> 31:34.160
This lead is crucial.

637
31:34.720 --> 31:35.319
Keep digging.

638
31:35.559 --> 31:36.039
Understood.

639
31:37.279 --> 31:38.559
I did force-feed him the liquor.

640
31:40.200 --> 31:42.200
But Zheng Aimin made me do it!

641
31:43.640 --> 31:44.519
If I didn't,

642
31:45.799 --> 31:46.519
he would beat me.

643
31:56.359 --> 31:57.720
Let me tell you, Chen Qingchun.

644
31:58.039 --> 31:59.559
If you want to survive in Lacheng,

645
31:59.960 --> 32:01.400
you do exactly as I say.

646
32:02.400 --> 32:03.079
Otherwise,

647
32:03.240 --> 32:04.519
both you and your son Chen Yuan

648
32:04.920 --> 32:05.839
are dead meat.

649
32:08.920 --> 32:09.519
Take it.

650
32:10.359 --> 32:11.000
Go.

651
32:14.079 --> 32:14.799
Hurry up!

652
32:24.920 --> 32:25.440
Pour it down.

653
32:26.079 --> 32:26.720
Hurry up!

654
32:32.240 --> 32:33.079
Pour more!

655
32:39.839 --> 32:40.759
Keep pouring!

656
32:49.240 --> 32:49.839
It's empty.

657
32:51.680 --> 32:52.319
Come on.

658
32:57.400 --> 32:58.799
Go to the back of the car.

659
32:59.039 --> 32:59.559
Hurry!

660
33:01.599 --> 33:02.519
The two of us will...

661
33:03.240 --> 33:04.000
...push the car down.

662
33:05.519 --> 33:06.519
It won't budge!

663
33:10.920 --> 33:11.400
Push harder!

664
33:12.160 --> 33:12.640
Three.

665
33:13.000 --> 33:13.519
Two.

666
33:48.160 --> 33:49.680
I killed that driver.

667
33:50.759 --> 33:52.960
But Zheng Aimin forced me to do it.

668
33:54.559 --> 33:56.519
He's the real killer.

669
33:57.559 --> 34:00.400
You can't let him escape justice.

670
34:05.119 --> 34:06.400
Now tell us,

671
34:07.440 --> 34:09.119
why on earth did you kill Cao Jun?

672
34:13.000 --> 34:15.519
I don't know how he found out about that.

673
34:52.079 --> 34:52.679
Where's the newspaper?

674
34:54.079 --> 34:54.679
Thanks.

675
35:00.519 --> 35:01.079
What are you looking at?

676
35:02.079 --> 35:02.519
Nothing.

677
35:02.519 --> 35:03.719
I came... came to see you.

678
35:04.360 --> 35:05.679
See me? What for?

679
35:06.559 --> 35:07.519
It's just about...

680
35:07.719 --> 35:08.199
well...

681
35:08.400 --> 35:09.440
that layoff issue.

682
35:11.280 --> 35:12.039
This factory now...

683
35:12.519 --> 35:13.719
belongs to Ma, not Chen.

684
35:13.840 --> 35:14.440
Coming to me won't help.

685
35:14.559 --> 35:15.679
You're... you're highly respected.

686
35:15.679 --> 35:17.519
C-Could you put in a word with Ma Guowen?

687
35:17.639 --> 35:18.039
I mean, I...

688
35:18.039 --> 35:19.719
I've won Model Worker twice!

689
35:20.519 --> 35:21.400
Look, if you won't help me,

690
35:21.440 --> 35:22.280
I won't let you leave.

691
35:22.360 --> 35:23.320
Fine, I'll talk, I'll talk!

692
35:24.159 --> 35:25.400
Alright, thank you!

693
35:27.519 --> 35:28.039
Thank you, Chief Engineer Chen.

694
35:28.039 --> 35:28.679
Thank you so much.

695
35:28.719 --> 35:29.239
You're welcome.

696
35:32.159 --> 35:32.840
Drive safe!

697
35:40.400 --> 35:41.280
It's fixed.

698
35:44.719 --> 35:45.599
Barbershop crew...

699
35:45.599 --> 35:46.239
How about some barbecue? Home appliance...

700
35:46.239 --> 35:47.119
Have them... repair team...

701
35:47.400 --> 35:48.039
Auto repair crew...

702
35:48.039 --> 35:49.199
It's the Lantern Festival. We're full.

703
35:49.199 --> 35:50.000
Have some sweet dumplings or something.

704
35:50.000 --> 35:50.719
Chief Engineer Chen.

705
35:50.719 --> 35:51.159
Right?

706
35:51.840 --> 35:52.599
Chief Engineer Chen.

707
35:54.159 --> 35:54.880
Attention, fellow workers.

708
35:54.880 --> 35:55.840
Chief Engineer Chen.

709
35:58.159 --> 35:58.880
Chief Engineer Chen.

710
35:59.320 --> 35:59.800
What's up?

711
36:00.519 --> 36:01.159
Chief Engineer Chen! Chief Engineer Chen!

712
36:01.159 --> 36:01.920
Stop patting me! Don't pat me!

713
36:02.119 --> 36:02.880
What are you patting me for?

714
36:02.880 --> 36:03.400
No, look...

715
36:03.719 --> 36:04.199
Look at this.

716
36:06.000 --> 36:06.719
In the end, they still...

717
36:06.719 --> 36:07.599
laid me off.

718
36:08.039 --> 36:08.599
Did you see that?

719
36:08.960 --> 36:09.239
Wait...

720
36:09.239 --> 36:10.559
Did you talk to Ma Guowen about this?

721
36:10.960 --> 36:11.840
I did, I did.

722
36:12.159 --> 36:13.400
Told him several times.

723
36:13.519 --> 36:14.599
Then talk to him again.

724
36:14.639 --> 36:15.039
Then what about me?

725
36:15.039 --> 36:15.920
What am I supposed to do here?

726
36:16.360 --> 36:17.280
If I bring it up again,

727
36:17.280 --> 36:18.679
he'll fire me too.

728
36:19.320 --> 36:20.159
Let's talk later.

729
36:20.679 --> 36:21.159
Bye-bye.

730
36:21.159 --> 36:21.639
Don't "later"!

731
36:22.000 --> 36:22.559
Old Chen!

732
36:23.880 --> 36:24.519
Cao Jun!

733
36:25.119 --> 36:26.639
Watch how you talk to the chief engineer!

734
36:26.639 --> 36:27.239
What's wrong?

735
36:27.920 --> 36:28.920
Chief Engineer Chen...

736
36:28.920 --> 36:30.920
is in-laws with the Industry Bureau Chief!

737
36:32.039 --> 36:32.559
With who?

738
36:32.760 --> 36:34.199
Zheng Aimin, head of Industry &amp; Commerce.

739
36:34.280 --> 36:35.079
You didn't know?

740
36:36.880 --> 36:37.360
Zheng Aimin?

741
36:37.360 --> 36:38.039
You didn't know about this?

742
36:38.519 --> 36:40.400
Acting all cocky, talking to him like that

743
36:40.639 --> 36:42.159
He's bound to make life difficult for you.

744
36:45.679 --> 36:46.239
Well...

745
36:46.639 --> 36:47.159
Fine.

746
36:48.880 --> 36:50.199
Ride carefully, don't wipe out!

747
36:52.840 --> 36:53.599
Tell me...

748
36:54.000 --> 36:55.760
Can a live-in son-in-law really end well?

749
36:55.800 --> 36:57.079
No way. Honestly.

750
36:57.280 --> 36:58.360
Look at us, isn't this much better?

751
37:02.519 --> 37:04.280
That day, my brother suddenly told me

752
37:05.360 --> 37:06.880
not to destroy that car.

753
37:07.639 --> 37:08.599
So did you destroy it?

754
37:09.199 --> 37:09.960
No.

755
37:13.440 --> 37:14.039
Cao Bing.

756
37:14.599 --> 37:15.639
You've gotta listen to me.

757
37:15.960 --> 37:17.920
Whatever you do, don't scrap this car.

758
37:18.519 --> 37:19.400
Why?

759
37:21.960 --> 37:22.440
Why?

760
37:23.679 --> 37:24.760
I'm telling you, if you scrap it,

761
37:25.199 --> 37:26.280
you'll be in serious trouble.

762
37:26.800 --> 37:27.639
Move aside.

763
37:28.519 --> 37:29.079
Take your hand off.

764
37:29.320 --> 37:29.760
Don't touch it.

765
37:30.199 --> 37:31.199
I'm taking pictures here.

766
37:32.519 --> 37:33.679
Why are you taking pictures?

767
37:34.559 --> 37:35.199
For what?

768
37:35.800 --> 37:37.199
Do you know who owns this car?

769
37:41.079 --> 37:41.519
Who, Bro?

770
37:41.559 --> 37:42.400
Do you know?

771
37:42.840 --> 37:43.719
Just tell me.

772
37:45.159 --> 37:46.159
Why're you so damn nosey?

773
37:46.960 --> 37:47.760
You really wanna know?

774
37:48.400 --> 37:49.440
If you found out,

775
37:49.960 --> 37:50.880
you'd be a dead man.

776
37:53.159 --> 37:54.199
Just keep in mind,

777
37:54.320 --> 37:55.719
you can't scrap this car.

778
37:56.199 --> 37:56.960
That's it. Wait,

779
37:57.079 --> 37:57.679
wait, Bro.

780
37:57.880 --> 37:59.159
How do I explain this to Brother Li?

781
37:59.559 --> 38:00.760
He's the one who said to scrap it.

782
38:04.119 --> 38:05.400
Or maybe tell Director Zheng...

783
38:06.199 --> 38:07.360
Look, here's what you do. Just find

784
38:07.360 --> 38:09.039
a similar one from these junk cars,

785
38:09.360 --> 38:09.920
smash it up,

786
38:09.920 --> 38:10.400
take a photo,

787
38:10.440 --> 38:12.360
and say it's scrapped. Problem solved.

788
38:14.360 --> 38:15.400
I'm heading back to work.

789
38:16.119 --> 38:18.199
S-So I just lie to Brother Li?

790
38:19.199 --> 38:20.639
You could tell the truth.

791
38:21.000 --> 38:21.800
But once you do,

792
38:21.800 --> 38:22.920
you're as good as dead.

793
38:24.960 --> 38:25.639
Then I won't say a word.

794
38:26.719 --> 38:27.000
Good.

795
38:27.079 --> 38:27.599
Wait, Bro,

796
38:28.000 --> 38:29.000
what about this car?

797
38:29.800 --> 38:30.320
This car?

798
38:31.079 --> 38:33.119
J-Just hide it away in some corner.

799
38:33.360 --> 38:34.360
Keep it out of sight.

800
38:34.599 --> 38:36.280
And don't touch it unless you have to.

801
38:37.239 --> 38:37.960
T-That's it.

802
38:38.119 --> 38:39.039
I-I'm taking off.

803
38:39.559 --> 38:40.159
Wait...

804
38:40.159 --> 38:40.840
By the way,

805
38:41.679 --> 38:43.440
don't go running your mouth to everyone

806
38:43.440 --> 38:44.239
a-about this.

807
38:44.599 --> 38:45.360
Don't be such a blabbermouth.

808
38:45.360 --> 38:45.800
Hear me?

809
38:46.199 --> 38:46.760
Besides,

810
38:46.880 --> 38:47.400
I never...

811
38:47.440 --> 38:48.400
I never taught you to do anything.

812
38:48.400 --> 38:48.880
Just take—

813
38:48.880 --> 38:49.840
Snap the photos, and you're clean.

814
38:49.840 --> 38:50.320
You hear me?

815
38:50.679 --> 38:51.599
You never saw me.

816
38:52.320 --> 38:52.960
I was never here.

817
38:54.920 --> 38:56.639
I didn't actually want to kill Cao Jun.

818
38:58.039 --> 38:59.280
He just wouldn't let it go.

819
39:02.079 --> 39:03.800
You didn't want to kill him,

820
39:04.239 --> 39:05.280
yet you did.

821
39:07.440 --> 39:09.239
Confess the details of your crime.

822
39:12.760 --> 39:14.119
You were the traitor back then,

823
39:14.239 --> 39:14.599
weren't you?

824
39:15.719 --> 39:16.840
You're slandering me!

825
39:17.320 --> 39:17.880
Slander my ass!

826
39:18.000 --> 39:19.000
Am I wrong?

827
39:19.280 --> 39:20.679
You're just a fence-sitter.

828
39:21.639 --> 39:22.840
You wanted to play both sides,

829
39:23.360 --> 39:25.119
but seeing Zheng Aimin backed Ma Guowen,

830
39:25.199 --> 39:26.400
you figured the odds were in their favor,

831
39:26.400 --> 39:27.559
so you turned traitor on the spot.

832
39:27.639 --> 39:28.519
You sold us out.

833
39:28.519 --> 39:28.960
Am I wrong?

834
39:29.679 --> 39:30.039
Right.

835
39:30.239 --> 39:30.519
Right.

836
39:30.719 --> 39:31.079
Fine, okay, okay.

837
39:31.079 --> 39:31.440
Right, my foot!

838
39:31.440 --> 39:32.079
Fine, fine, fine.

839
39:32.760 --> 39:34.719
That betrayal happened over a decade ago.

840
39:34.960 --> 39:35.679
Let's not dwell on it.

841
39:36.559 --> 39:37.519
Let's talk about the present.

842
39:39.559 --> 39:41.519
This car looks familiar, doesn't it?

843
39:45.239 --> 39:47.000
And this car's engine number...

844
39:47.920 --> 39:48.639
You still remember it, right?

845
39:53.400 --> 39:55.360
W-What's this?

846
39:58.880 --> 40:00.280
It's 200,000.

847
40:00.719 --> 40:02.679
What you owe me.

848
40:02.840 --> 40:04.719
W-When did I ever owe—

849
40:04.760 --> 40:05.400
For-for-for—

850
40:05.440 --> 40:06.000
Forgot?

851
40:07.360 --> 40:08.440
You can't forget this.

852
40:08.920 --> 40:10.360
This involves a human life.

853
40:12.039 --> 40:12.679
But that's fine.

854
40:13.519 --> 40:14.400
Director Zheng surely remembers.

855
40:14.400 --> 40:15.519
Right, he isn't the director anymore.

856
40:15.679 --> 40:16.079
Doesn't matter.

857
40:17.079 --> 40:17.880
We can go ask him together.

858
40:17.920 --> 40:18.840
H-He knows about this?

859
40:19.920 --> 40:21.239
What the hell do you want?

860
40:24.280 --> 40:25.760
I'm going to Hainan.

861
40:27.679 --> 40:29.599
Give me the 200,000 you owe me,

862
40:30.320 --> 40:31.119
and I'll leave right away.

863
40:31.440 --> 40:32.400
Don't try to hide.

864
40:32.400 --> 40:34.039
I know where your son works.

865
40:34.199 --> 40:34.719
Three days.

866
40:35.440 --> 40:36.280
I'm giving you three days.

867
40:38.760 --> 40:39.679
Think it over.

868
40:49.519 --> 40:49.880
Oh, right.

869
40:51.199 --> 40:52.239
I have that car.

870
40:53.159 --> 40:54.000
It wasn't destroyed.

871
40:59.800 --> 41:00.920
He came to extort me,

872
41:01.719 --> 41:02.800
and threatened me.

873
41:03.360 --> 41:04.599
If I didn't give him money,

874
41:06.039 --> 41:08.119
he'd make trouble at Xiaoyuan's school

875
41:09.320 --> 41:11.519
and ruin Chen Yuan's promotion.

876
41:12.639 --> 41:13.719
In all my life,

877
41:14.280 --> 41:15.719
I've done so many wrong things,

878
41:16.880 --> 41:18.039
all for Xiaoyuan.

879
41:18.679 --> 41:20.400
If he dared mess with Xiaoyuan,

880
41:21.079 --> 41:22.360
I'd never let him off.

881
41:28.519 --> 41:29.320
Director Zheng,

882
41:30.880 --> 41:32.679
this photo is fake.

883
41:33.119 --> 41:34.519
You've been duped.

884
41:35.199 --> 41:37.800
Cao Jun showed me that photo.

885
41:38.760 --> 41:40.679
The engine number was right on it.

886
41:41.400 --> 41:43.239
That car is still out there.

887
41:48.960 --> 41:50.039
He blackmailed you.

888
41:53.000 --> 41:54.440
He demanded 200,000 from me.

889
41:55.639 --> 41:57.559
I... I can't come up with that much.

890
41:58.360 --> 42:00.840
Do you think the two of us could...

891
42:01.559 --> 42:02.519
pool our money?

892
42:13.000 --> 42:15.239
Once he gets to Hainan, he'll realize

893
42:15.679 --> 42:17.159
200,000 won't get him anywhere.

894
42:17.960 --> 42:19.239
What happens then?

895
42:22.880 --> 42:23.760
That's true.

896
42:30.360 --> 42:31.519
For the rest of his life,

897
42:32.039 --> 42:33.559
he's going to leech off you.

898
42:33.960 --> 42:34.880
Old Chen,

899
42:35.559 --> 42:36.400
this whole thing,

900
42:36.760 --> 42:39.239
you need to figure it out yourself.

901
42:39.679 --> 42:40.159
Right.

902
42:40.159 --> 42:42.639
That's why I came to figure it out with you.

903
42:44.159 --> 42:45.599
What's there to figure out with me?

904
42:46.880 --> 42:48.000
You were the one driving.

905
42:48.840 --> 42:50.199
You were the one who fled the scene.

906
42:50.400 --> 42:52.280
And you forced liquor down his throat!

907
42:53.679 --> 42:54.760
The one driving was clearly...

908
42:55.039 --> 42:56.199
It was clearly you!

909
42:56.400 --> 42:58.159
I've never had a license my whole life.

910
42:58.199 --> 42:59.360
How could I drive?

911
43:00.679 --> 43:01.880
You drove the car!

912
43:02.039 --> 43:03.199
You were speeding!

913
43:03.320 --> 43:04.440
You crashed it!

914
43:04.559 --> 43:06.719
And you made me pour liquor into him!

915
43:06.920 --> 43:07.760
You... Chen Qingchun!

916
43:07.880 --> 43:09.719
Are you drunk and talking nonsense?

917
43:10.079 --> 43:10.760
If you keep this up,

918
43:10.800 --> 43:12.360
I'll have Chen Yuan come take you home.

919
43:13.119 --> 43:15.119
I'm not putting up with your drunken antics.

920
43:25.800 --> 43:27.199
If you want to give it,

921
43:27.280 --> 43:28.079
then give it.

922
43:29.039 --> 43:30.159
If you don't want to,

923
43:30.400 --> 43:31.360
then drop dead.

924
43:35.800 --> 43:36.960
As for Cao Jun,

925
43:37.519 --> 43:38.760
he has a death wish.

926
43:40.320 --> 43:40.960
Right, Ali?

927
43:42.360 --> 43:44.079
Our Ali is much more obedient.

928
44:03.920 --> 44:05.320
I reviewed the old unused footage

929
44:06.280 --> 44:07.400
and noticed a few things

930
44:08.119 --> 44:09.519
that might be clues for your case.

931
44:09.519 --> 44:12.519
He had feelings for Liu Xuemei.

932
44:12.760 --> 44:13.760
That could also be

933
44:13.760 --> 44:16.239
Liu Tieping's motive for killing Qian.

934
44:16.239 --> 44:17.519
Put them both under surveillance now.

935
44:17.639 --> 44:18.679
It's an emergency!

936
44:19.000 --> 44:20.239
I don't know what happened to Cheng,

937
44:20.239 --> 44:21.280
but he was loaded into an ambulance.

938
44:21.599 --> 44:22.559
Liu Tieping is with him too.

939
44:23.079 --> 44:23.679
Damn it.

940
44:24.079 --> 44:24.880
Call Brother Chuang!

941
44:25.599 --> 44:26.559
We lost Liu Tieping!
